      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start and it definitely hits the keywords. i'm a bit worried though, it feels a little... light? like it's hitting the points but maybe not going deep enough into the actual impact on the people. \n\ncould you expand on this? try to make it more substantial and detailed. i want people to actually feel the weight of what this project does. just keep in mind that \"board screening\" thing i mentioned—even if you go longer and add more detail, please don't let it turn into just a list of those buzzwords. if it starts sounding like a checklist, it's game over for us.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
